    "detailed_description": "Trade City is a simple city building game that you build your own city by building/developing new buildings.Grow your city with production and trade, and conquer other cities on the map without fighting.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build &amp; Grow</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481820/extras/af80e4fd2034edd1ad6bbb7e14e5ce22.avif?t=1689955320\" /></span><br><br>There are various structures in the game: houses, parks and workshops... Use these structures to increase your population and produce. Do not neglect to improve your structures and make your people happy. Remember, happy workers mean more production and taxes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Production</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481820/extras/c70aad76208ca21ede7fdb06a3cd9c05.poster.avif?t=1689955320\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481820/extras/c70aad76208ca21ede7fdb06a3cd9c05.webm?t=1689955320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481820/extras/c70aad76208ca21ede7fdb06a3cd9c05.mp4?t=1689955320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Listen to the needs of your people and the world. Offer what is demanded.<br>Produce products with high added value and earn more, always win!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rule !</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481820/extras/fdfdc95393ebe9f728e5759f3dde08ea.poster.avif?t=1689955320\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481820/extras/fdfdc95393ebe9f728e5759f3dde08ea.webm?t=1689955320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481820/extras/fdfdc95393ebe9f728e5759f3dde08ea.mp4?t=1689955320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Trade with other cities. Send gifts from time to time and please their hearts. Be with them in difficult times. Become the beloved of the people's. Influence them. <br>That's the only way you can rule them.",
